      "parameters": {
        "html": "=<h2>🔒 Auto-Firewall Lockdown Activated</h2><p>A traffic-driven CPU spike was detected and the lockdown firewall was activated automatically.</p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 12px 4px 0;\"><strong>VPS</strong></td><td>{{ $('Config: Detection Settings').item.json.vpsId }}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 12px 4px 0;\"><strong>CPU Usage</strong></td><td>{{ $('Analyze Metrics').item.json.formattedCpu }}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 12px 4px 0;\"><strong>Incoming Traffic</strong></td><td>{{ $('Analyze Metrics').item.json.formattedIncoming }} (baseline {{ $('Analyze Metrics').item.json.formattedBaselineIncoming }})</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 12px 4px 0;\"><strong>Outgoing Traffic</strong></td><td>{{ $('Analyze Metrics').item.json.formattedOutgoing }} (baseline {{ $('Analyze Metrics').item.json.formattedBaselineOutgoing }})</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 12px 4px 0;\"><strong>Detected At</strong></td><td>{{ $('Analyze Metrics').item.json.formattedTimestamp }}</td></tr></table><p>Lockdown firewall \"<strong>{{ $('Config: Detection Settings').item.json.lockdownFirewallName }}</strong>\" (allowing only ports {{ $('Config: Detection Settings').item.json.allowedPorts }}) is now active on this VPS.</p><p><em>Review traffic and manually deactivate/revert once the spike clears — auto-revert isn't built yet.</em></p>",
        "options": {},
        "subject": "=[Alert] Auto-firewall lockdown activated on VPS {{ $('Config: Detection Settings').item.json.vpsId }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $('Config: Detection Settings').item.json.notificationEmail }}",
