      "parameters": {
        "html": "=<h2>⚠️ CPU Spike Detected — Not Traffic-Driven</h2><p>A CPU spike was detected but traffic looks normal, so no firewall action was taken.</p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse;\"><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 12px 4px 0;\"><strong>VPS</strong></td><td>{{ $('Config: Detection Settings').item.json.vpsId }}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 12px 4px 0;\"><strong>CPU Usage</strong></td><td>{{ $('Analyze Metrics').item.json.formattedCpu }}</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 12px 4px 0;\"><strong>Incoming Traffic</strong></td><td>{{ $('Analyze Metrics').item.json.formattedIncoming }} (baseline {{ $('Analyze Metrics').item.json.formattedBaselineIncoming }})</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 12px 4px 0;\"><strong>Outgoing Traffic</strong></td><td>{{ $('Analyze Metrics').item.json.formattedOutgoing }} (baseline {{ $('Analyze Metrics').item.json.formattedBaselineOutgoing }})</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:4px 12px 4px 0;\"><strong>Detected At</strong></td><td>{{ $('Analyze Metrics').item.json.formattedTimestamp }}</td></tr></table><h3>Top CPU-consuming processes</h3>{{ $('Format Process List').item.json.processListHtml }}<h3>AI Analysis</h3><p>{{ $('Parse AI Analysis').item.json.aiAnalysis }}</p><p><strong>Reply \"KILL\" to this email to terminate the flagged processes</strong> ({{ $('Format Process List').item.json.flaggedPids.join(', ') }}). A snapshot will be taken automatically first.</p><p><em>Case ID: {{ $('Build Log Entry').item.json.caseId }}</em></p>",
        "options": {},
